WEBVTT

00:00.300 --> 00:05.900
Mom has three hospitals, two portals and one of you.

00:06.200 --> 00:11.100
Her records from Duke Health and other hospitals, in one place.

00:11.800 --> 00:17.100
Wellet notices patterns over weeks and puts them where they began.

00:17.800 --> 00:21.600
The night before a visit, the questions are ready.

00:22.300 --> 00:27.600
Ask about her records. Answers come from her chart, with sources.

00:28.300 --> 00:32.600
Share with the people helping, only what she chooses.

00:33.300 --> 00:37.100
Keep her wishes in her words.

00:37.900 --> 00:43.900
Her records stay hers. We don't sell data. No ad tools in the app.

00:44.600 --> 00:50.747
2.38 million North Carolinians care for someone. More than one in four adults here.

00:53.300 --> 00:59.500
For help close to home, the Central Pines Area Agency on Aging is one call away.

01:00.600 --> 01:05.300
Wellet. For the person holding someone else's chart.
